Language.String:
The starter runs the simulator ({0}) from the folder it was started in:
{1}

There is no simulator there, so Start will not work.

This processor has no AVX2 and the official simulator needs it: it will not start.

There is a simulator build without AVX2 - its file name ends in _noavx2. Put it in the game folder and the starter will use it. You can also build the simulator yourself (CMake -DENABLE_AVX2=OFF). Instructions:
{0}
